---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ProcedureScenario[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for releaseInstruction. Obtain qualified review of the exact variant, publish controlled copies, and coordinate acknowledgment or training. Retire outdated copies without erasing historical execution records and re-evaluate affected instructions when equipment or master procedures change. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
